>> title: Anzac Biscuits
>> category: Cookies
>> tags: oats, coconut, golden syrup, australian, oven
>> counters: Bakery
>> aka: anzacs, anzac cookies, golden syrup oat biscuits
>> servings: 24
>> time: 35 min

Heat the #oven{} to 325°F (165°C) and line two #baking sheets{} with parchment.

>> step: stir together
Stir together @rolled oats{1%cup}(90 g), @all-purpose flour{1%cup}(125 g), @desiccated coconut{1%cup}(85 g), and @light brown sugar{3/4%cup}(165 g).

Melt @unsalted butter{125%g}(4 1/2 oz) with @golden syrup{2%Tbs}(45 g).

Dissolve @baking soda{1%tsp}(6 g) in @boiling water{2%Tbs}(30 mL).

>> step: stir in
Add @&(~1)soda water{} to @&(~2)melted butter{}.

Pour @&(~1)syrup mixture{} over @&(~4)dry ingredients{} and mix.

Bake @&(~1)dough{} in rounded spoonfuls at 325°F for ~{15%min}.
